  "highlights": [
    "Check one service without waiting for a full refresh — AI clients can read the latest collected status or request a fresh check of one service, with clear information about when it was collected and whether an action reached readiness.",
    "Adopt discoveries as monitors — keep a discovered service visible from an issue without adding start or stop controls. Memory findings now account for known runtime limits and pressure on your Mac, and loaded but idle background jobs have a distinct status.",
    "AI workflows spend less time polling — clients can wait for tracked actions and fixes to change, inspect concise repair previews, and get starting guidance that matches their available tools and access."
